        "created_at": "2013-12-21T20:52:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Envisioner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Envisioner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Other changes that have been made include fixing Darken the Sky's art, and sadly doing away with Checmical Explosions.&nbsp; Alas, the Rook City environment deck's language was not fixed; Tony Taurus still says \"immune to damage from heroes\" and \"the villain character card\".</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Can you elaborate on this a bit?</p>",
        "post_number": 221,
        "post_type": 1,
