        "created_at": "2013-12-21T23:22:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The art of Darken the Sky is all pixellated.</p><p>\"Checmical\" should read \"Chemical\".</p><p>\"Damage from heroes\" doesn't excuse other hero targets like Unity's bots.</p><p>\"The villain character card\" implies only one is present, when that's not always the case (Chairman/Operative, Ennead).</p>",
