        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"The villain character card\" implies only one is present, when that's not always the case (Chairman/Operative, Ennead).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>With Chairman and Operative, there is still only one Villain Character card, which is Chairman.</p>",
